# @tcforce: rows with the retained terrain cache forced on
# (OPENPETE_TERRAIN_CACHE_FORCE=1; on the software rasteriser terrain otherwise
# draws through the CPU walk) and the first-touch bake budget off (a wall-time
# budget makes the walked set differ between runs), so the sectors in view draw
# from the cache on every leg. Each row is the twin of the plain row at the
# same pose: a change to the cache path moves the @tcforce tiles and not the
# plain ones. With the @tcforce rows of presentation-corpus.manifest they cover,
# per game, a hub or portal view, extended-LOD low-poly sectors, near-clipped
# sectors, the largest retained sector counts, a flight or speedway level and a
# moving camera.
sunny_beach@tcforce | pos=(30097, 21908, 44979) yaw=523 pitch=226 | | OPENPETE_TERRAIN_CACHE_FORCE=1 OPENPETE_TC_BAKE_BUDGET_US=off
canyon_speedway@tcforce | pos=(66451, 83321, 27812) yaw=1839 pitch=0 | | OPENPETE_TERRAIN_CACHE_FORCE=1 OPENPETE_TC_BAKE_BUDGET_US=off
metropolis@tcforce | pos=(115904, 59478, 40916) yaw=1696 pitch=160 | | OPENPETE_TERRAIN_CACHE_FORCE=1 OPENPETE_TC_BAKE_BUDGET_US=off
autumn_plains@tcforce | pos=(89729, 42806, 34729) yaw=1009 pitch=113 | | OPENPETE_TERRAIN_CACHE_FORCE=1 OPENPETE_TC_BAKE_BUDGET_US=off
winter_tundra@tcforce | pos=(51217, 30497, 40037) yaw=752 pitch=160 | | OPENPETE_TERRAIN_CACHE_FORCE=1 OPENPETE_TC_BAKE_BUDGET_US=off
# Sector visibility: each pair is one pose under two sector visibility modes at
# one commit, the tiles the mode separates. A leak control pairs frustum with
# filled: frustum draws geometry the level's PVS lists from no cell near the
# camera (single-sided shells seen from behind), filled must not. A hole row
# pairs game with filled: the game's PVS omits a sector its neighbour cells
# list (sky through the floor or a wall), filled draws it. Poses are the camera
# at the press tick of tester reports, read from the report's RAM.
# Leak control: the castle behind the ridge (frustum draws its far interior;
# the original draws sky).
summer_forest@sv-frustum | pos=(117227, 81537, 43219) yaw=1973 pitch=-9 | | --sector-visibility frustum
summer_forest@sv-filled | pos=(117227, 81537, 43219) yaw=1973 pitch=-9 | | --sector-visibility filled
